er chooses you. The deadline is 48 hours after that; when late, the Learner is told and may move it to" style="text;html=0;spacing=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=13.6;fontColor=#333333;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="133.0" y="740.2" width="1013.9" height="18.4" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c190" value="another Examiner (at most twice), and it leaves your queue." style="text;html=0;spacing=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=13.6;fontColor=#333333;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="133.0" y="760.6" width="437.3" height="18.4" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c191" value="You take at most 5 new essays a day, Writing and Speaking together; at 5, Learners" style="text;html=0;spacing=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=13.6;fontColor=#333333;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="492.4" y="760.6" width="603.1" height="18.4" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c192" value="cannot choose you until the day ends." style="text;html=0;spacing=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=13.6;fontColor=#333333;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="133.0" y="780.9" width="278.7" height="18.4" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c193" value="1" style="ellipse;fillColor=#c0392b;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="699.4" y="80.0" width="22.0" height="22.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c194" value="2" style="ellipse;fillColor=#c0392b;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="793.5" y="253.3" width="22.0" height="22.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c195" value="3" style="ellipse;fillColor=#c0392b;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="761.7" y="309.3" width="22.0" height="22.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c196" value="4" style="ellipse;fillColor=#c0392b